              "heading": "ZX Bank Branches in Patna – Regional Directory"
            },
            "text": "Patna, one of eastern India’s major urban centers, is well-served by the extensive branch network of ZX Bank. With a robust presence spread evenly across all major regions of the city — North, South, East, West, and Central Patna — customers benefit from convenient access to comprehensive banking facilities. The following directory enumerates ZX Bank’s 13 branches, distributed to ensure seamless service throughout Patna’s diverse neighborhoods."
